WEBVTT

00:00:06.377 --> 00:00:08.663
<v><b>Speaker:</b></v> What is a bucket list?

00:00:09.591 --> 00:00:13.570
It’s a list of things that you want to do before you die.

00:00:15.175 --> 00:00:21.850
The expression comes from an English idiom, “to kick the bucket,” which means to die.

00:00:25.460 --> 00:00:28.622
Some people make a new bucket list every year.

00:00:29.988 --> 00:00:34.125
Others start one when they’re young and keep on adding to it.

00:00:36.321 --> 00:00:43.000
Others set a time limit, for example, “Things I want to do before I’m 30.”

00:00:46.483 --> 00:00:49.135
What kind of things do people put on them?

00:00:49.789 --> 00:00:51.642
All sorts of things.

00:00:52.603 --> 00:01:00.498
Many are to do with travel, for example, travel to all seven continents,

00:01:03.638 --> 00:01:04.858
go on a cruise

00:01:07.936 --> 00:01:09.640
see the northern lights

00:01:11.260 --> 00:01:12.682
go on a safari.

00:01:15.294 --> 00:01:19.158
Others are about adventures, for example,

00:01:20.089 --> 00:01:21.520
do a bungee jump

00:01:23.920 --> 00:01:25.753
hike through a rainforest

00:01:27.642 --> 00:01:29.640
ride a horse on the beach.

00:01:33.629 --> 00:01:39.103
Some involve learning new skills, for example,

00:01:39.700 --> 00:01:41.347
learn to scuba dive

00:01:41.371 --> 00:01:44.215
learn to play an instrument

00:01:46.483 --> 00:01:48.102
learn to play chess

00:01:50.437 --> 00:01:51.577
learn to cook

00:01:54.351 --> 00:02:00.909
And others are just random things people would like to do, for example,

00:02:01.685 --> 00:02:03.476
see the sun rise

00:02:05.042 --> 00:02:06.700
go on a blind date

00:02:08.887 --> 00:02:10.640
be an extra in a movie

00:02:12.877 --> 00:02:13.960
get a tattoo

00:02:16.103 --> 00:02:17.343
be on TV

00:02:19.982 --> 00:02:22.240
see a tennis match at Wimbledon

00:02:24.636 --> 00:02:26.400
read a classic novel

00:02:29.005 --> 00:02:31.673
What would you put on your bucket list?